        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 65858, Classic Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic design of the 65858 Omnia Narrow Backset Lockset makes it easy to add both style and functionality to any door in your home. It will look great amid almost any decor from period-style homes to modern day styles and since the backplate and the handle are both made of solid brass, it will last for a very long time. It is paired with the scroll lever which elevates the handleset and makes it elegant without being gaudy. This Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 1-1/2 inches or 2 inches. It is available in 4 finishes in a wide array of functions including standard single cylinder, passage, and double cylinder entry.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available Matching <a href=\"/products/scroll-lever-omnia-858-00\"><b>Scroll Leverset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Narrow Backset Handleset with Scroll Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ADA compliant.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid brass with a heavy gauge plated steel case.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass 1/2\" lachbolt and 1\" deadbolt</li>\r\n<li>Schlage \"C\" keyway (for key functions).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Mortise Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backplate Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 1-1/2\" or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\" x lip 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1/2\" x 3/4\" x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" x 1\" x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Case:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1-1/2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-5/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-13/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN_narrow_bs_mortise_dimentions.pdf?v=1704262277\" target=\"new\"><b>Narrow Backset Mortise Lock Specification Diagram</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
