                "description": "Omnia 65858 Traditional Narrow Backset Handleset - The classic design of the 65858 Omnia Narrow Backset Lockset makes it easy to add both style and functionality to any door in your home. It will look great amid almost any decor from period-style homes to modern day styles and since the backplate and the handle are both made of solid brass, it will last for a very long time. It is paired with the scroll lever which elevates the handleset and makes it elegant without being gaudy. This Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 1-1/2 inches or 2 inches. It is available in 4 finishes in a wide array of functions including standard single cylinder, passage, and double cylinder entry.",
                "keywords": "small backset locksets, omnia narrow backset mortise locks, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, OMN-65858, Omnia 65858, Traditional Narrow Backset Handlesets, Classic Narrow Backset Mortise Locksets, narrow backset handlesets, Classic handlesets, Traditional handlesets, Classic entrance sets, Classic mortise entrancesets, Classic front door handles, omnia scroll levers,"
